{
  "about": [
    "The built-in categories. A new user gets the 'personal' or the 'business' set of their kind; 'itemized' is added on demand (itemized taxation). At every start each user gets the ones of their sets they have never had, once (one they deleted doesn't come back).",
    "Add: a new, unique key (never a used one). Remove: \"retired\": true instead of deleting it, so the users who have it still see its name translated. Never change a key: a user's category keeps the key it was made with. Keys the code uses: businessIncome, businessExpense.",
    "type: income / expense; color: one of the app's category colors; icon: a key of categoryIcons; treatment: a TaxTreatment (itemized taxation), none if left out; names: en (required), hu."
